    "About Actions": {
      "comment": "A section header describing the purpose of actions in Docky.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于快捷操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Docky": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acerca de Docky"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于 Docky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access Via": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acceder vía"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访问方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Action Keys": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作按键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Action kinds Docky will execute: built-in commands, AppleScript, and macOS menu-bar clicks. The first time an app-targeted AppleScript or menu-click action runs, macOS may prompt for Automation permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docky 支持内置命令、AppleScript 和 macOS 菜单栏操作。首次执行针对应用的 AppleScript 或菜单点击操作时，macOS 可能会请求自动化权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actions are menu items Docky injects into each tile's right-click menu. A catalog package ships a curated bundle of them; once it's loaded, every action it defines is automatically available on the matching tile type. Apps, folders, the Trash, the Launchpad, and the divider all get their own set, with no per-tile setup needed.": {
      "comment": "A description of how actions are integrated into Docky.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷操作会添加到各类项目的右键菜单中。操作目录包包含一组预设操作；载入后，相关操作会自动显示在对应类型的项目上。应用、文件夹、废纸篓、启动台和分隔线都有各自的操作，无需逐项配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
