    "Apple's classic Launchpad: pages of icons that swipe horizontally with a page indicator below.": {
      "comment": "A description of the \"horizontal\" Launchpad layout axis.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 经典启动台：图标按页横向排列，可左右滑动，下方显示页码指示点。"
          }
        }
