      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't install widget": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法安装小组件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing widgets from links is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未允许通过链接安装小组件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For safety, Docky won't install a widget from a link until you turn this on in Settings › Widget Store.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为确保安全，请先在“设置 → 小组件商店”中开启此选项，再通过链接安装小组件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widgets are native plugins that run inside Docky with the same access Docky has — Accessibility, Automation, files, and more. Docky can't verify what a widget does. Only continue if you trust this source.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小组件是直接在 Docky 内运行的原生插件，可使用 Docky 已获得的辅助功能、自动化和文件等权限。Docky 无法验证小组件的具体行为，请仅安装你信任的来源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download & Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载并安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preferences…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "偏好设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location access is needed for local weather.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要定位权限才能显示本地天气。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weather is unavailable right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
