    "Import Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the switcher is open, keep the shortcut modifiers held and tap the shortcut again to cycle. In Instant Focus mode, each step immediately focuses the next window and releasing the modifiers ends cycling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换器打开时，保持按住修饰键，并再次按快捷键逐项切换。在“即时激活”模式下，每一步都会立即激活下一个窗口；松开修饰键后结束切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the switcher is open, keep the shortcut modifiers held and tap the shortcut again to cycle. Release the modifiers to focus the selected window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换器打开时，保持按住修饰键，并再次按快捷键逐项切换。松开修饰键后激活选中的窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按下按键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow installing widgets from links": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许通过链接安装小组件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Links like `docky://install-widget` let a web page install a widget. Off by default. Widgets are native plugins that run inside Docky with the same access Docky has — Accessibility, Automation, files, and more — and Docky doesn't sandbox or verify them, so only install widgets you trust. Installing a `.dockywidget` file yourself always works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "类似 docky://install-widget 的链接可从网页发起小组件安装，默认关闭。小组件是直接在 Docky 内运行的原生插件，可使用 Docky 已获得的辅助功能、自动化和文件等权限，且不会经过沙盒隔离或行为验证。请仅安装你信任的小组件。手动安装 .dockywidget 文件不受此开关影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " (file missing)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（文件丢失）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Widget": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装小组件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
