            "value": "调整程序坞主窗口及边框的圆角，最大可形成完整胶囊形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Circle mode uses the maximum radius automatically, so square chrome becomes circular and wider chrome becomes a capsule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圆形模式自动使用最大圆角半径：正方形面板会变为圆形，较宽的面板会变为胶囊形。"
