            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permission is already enabled. You can continue when ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此权限已开启，可以继续下一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has this disabled right now. Open System Settings, enable it, then come back and re-check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 当前尚未开启此权限。请打开系统偏好设置并启用，然后回到这里重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Docky will guide you through the fastest way to enable this on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docky 会引导你以合适的方式开启这台 Mac 上的权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preview pinned folders instantly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即时预览固定文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reveal and manage files in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在访达中显示和管理文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Control interface actions smoothly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顺畅执行界面操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run curated menu actions quickly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速执行预设菜单操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capture live window previews": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示实时窗口预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show local weather in the dock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在程序坞中显示本地天气"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show upcoming events in the dock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在程序坞中显示即将开始的日程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show open tasks in the dock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在程序坞中显示未完成任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finder access can be requested here now, so reveal-in-Finder and Trash actions work without waiting for the first macOS prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以直接在这里请求访达权限，使“在访达中显示”和废纸篓操作正常工作，无需等首次操作触发 macOS 提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Events access can be requested here now for curated menu-click actions. Accessibility should be enabled too, since UI scripting depends on both permissions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以直接在这里请求 System Events 权限，用于执行预设菜单点击操作。界面脚本还依赖辅助功能权限，请同时开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permission unlocks a core Docky feature, but you can skip it for now and grant it later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此权限用于 Docky 的核心功能。你可以暂时跳过，以后再授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permission unlocks an optional feature and can be granted later from Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此权限用于可选功能，可稍后在设置中授权。"
